      "id": "1",
      "title": "Situation overview",
      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "1a",
          "title": "Overview",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "1a.1",
              "text": "An industrial fire occurred at Kellet Point industrial estate, referred to as the Kellet Point Fire or industrial fire in the crisis area. The fire triggered warnings for nearby populated areas (Brayle and Sunder Flats), evacuation of approximately 2,300 residents from Brayle, and evacuation of approximately 300 residents from Osmery. Response included deployment of multiple organizations (Fallon Coatings, Provincial Environmental Protection Agency/PEPA, and operational personnel). Road closures were implemented in the affected industrial estate and surrounding areas. Injuries were documented in the town and confirmed in <PERSON>. No fatalities were reported in connection with the fire. No contamination was recorded in the canal.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
